Package: ggkodom
Title: Visualize Individual Longitudinal Trajectories
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Subrata", "Pal", , "subrata@iastate.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ayoushman", "Bhattacharya", role = "aut")
  )
Description: A ggplot2-based toolkit for visualizing individual-level
    longitudinal trajectories. Creates swimlane plots, circular 'kodom'
    plots, heatmaps, and state-ribbon charts for repeated-measures data.
    Each subject gets its own visual lane with measurements colored by
    value, revealing patterns across subjects and time. The circular
    variant resembles the Kadam flower (Neolamarckia cadamba).
